*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% HP Laser 103/107/108 - open-source SPL driver for macOS (hp10x)
*% SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
*% Not affiliated with or endorsed by HP Inc. Page sizes and printable areas follow
*% the Samsung M2020-series engine these printers are built on.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "0.1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "HP10X.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "HP"
*Product: "(HP Laser 103 107 108)"
*Product: "(HP Laser 103a)"
*Product: "(HP Laser 107a)"
*Product: "(HP Laser 107w)"
*Product: "(HP Laser 108a)"
*Product: "(HP Laser 108w)"
*ModelName: "HP Laser 103 107 108"
*ShortNickName: "HP Laser 103/107/108 (hp10x)"
*NickName: "HP Laser 103/107/108 (hp10x open-source driver)"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:HP;MDL:HP Laser 103 107 108;CMD:SPL;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "20"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsLanguages: "en"
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 /Library/Printers/hp10x/Filters/rastertohp10x"

*% 600 dpi, 8-bit gray: the filter screens gray itself.
*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *TonerSave/Toner Save: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *TonerSave
*DefaultTonerSave: False
*TonerSave True/On: ""
*TonerSave False/Off: ""
*CloseUI: *TonerSave

*OpenUI *InputSlot/Paper Source: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *InputSlot
*DefaultInputSlot: Auto
*InputSlot Auto/Automatic: "<</cupsMediaPosition 1>>setpagedevice"
*InputSlot Manual/Manual Feed: "<</cupsMediaPosition 2>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *InputSlot

*OpenUI *PageSize/Page Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Letter
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B5/B5 (JIS): "<</PageSize[516 729]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize ISOB5/B5 (ISO): "<</PageSize[499 709]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize FanFoldGermanLegal/Folio: "<</PageSize[612 936]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 8.5x13.5/Oficio: "<</PageSize[612 972]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 4x6/Postcard 4x6: "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvC5/Envelope C5: "<</PageSize[459 649]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvDL/Envelope DL: "<</PageSize[312 624]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Env10/Envelope #10: "<</PageSize[297 684]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvMonarch/Envelope Monarch: "<</PageSize[279 540]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Page Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Letter
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion B5/B5 (JIS): "<</PageSize[516 729]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion ISOB5/B5 (ISO): "<</PageSize[499 709]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion FanFoldGermanLegal/Folio: "<</PageSize[612 936]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 8.5x13.5/Oficio: "<</PageSize[612 972]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 4x6/Postcard 4x6: "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvC5/Envelope C5: "<</PageSize[459 649]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvDL/Envelope DL: "<</PageSize[312 624]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Env10/Envelope #10: "<</PageSize[297 684]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvMonarch/Envelope Monarch: "<</PageSize[279 540]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Letter
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "12.24 12.06 599.76 780.06"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "12.5 12.5 599.5 995.5"
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "12.5 12.5 582.5 829.5"
*ImageableArea A5/A5: "12.5 12.5 407.5 582.5"
*ImageableArea B5/B5 (JIS): "12.5 12.5 503.5 716.5"
*ImageableArea ISOB5/B5 (ISO): "13.2 12.06 485.52 696.54"
*ImageableArea Executive/Executive: "13.3 12.1 508.7 744.1"
*ImageableArea FanFoldGermanLegal/Folio: "12.5 12.5 599.5 923.5"
*ImageableArea 8.5x13.5/Oficio: "12.5 12.5 599.5 959.5"
*ImageableArea 4x6/Postcard 4x6: "12.5 12.5 275.5 419.5"
*ImageableArea EnvC5/Envelope C5: "12.6 12.1 446.5 637"
*ImageableArea EnvDL/Envelope DL: "13.8 12.1 297.9 611.6"
*ImageableArea Env10/Envelope #10: "13 13 284.5 671.5"
*ImageableArea EnvMonarch/Envelope Monarch: "12.7 12.1 266.2 528.1"

*DefaultPaperDimension: Letter
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/US Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension A5/A5: "420 595"
*PaperDimension B5/B5 (JIS): "516 729"
*PaperDimension ISOB5/B5 (ISO): "499 709"
*PaperDimension Executive/Executive: "522 756"
*PaperDimension FanFoldGermanLegal/Folio: "612 936"
*PaperDimension 8.5x13.5/Oficio: "612 972"
*PaperDimension 4x6/Postcard 4x6: "288 432"
*PaperDimension EnvC5/Envelope C5: "459 649"
*PaperDimension EnvDL/Envelope DL: "312 624"
*PaperDimension Env10/Envelope #10: "297 684"
*PaperDimension EnvMonarch/Envelope Monarch: "279 540"

*MaxMediaWidth: "612"
*MaxMediaHeight: "1008"
*HWMargins: 12.24 12.06 12.24 12.06
*% End of HP-Laser-10x.ppd
